# Only hand-written configuration belongs in this directory.
#
# ~/.emacs.d is a real *local* directory now, and the files here are symlinked
# into it.  All generated state -- package checkouts and builds, native-comp
# output, backups, undo history, caches -- lives in ~/.emacs.d and never touches
# Dropbox, because syncing it across machines produced conflicted copies and
# gigabytes of churn.
#
# If any of the following ever reappear here, something is writing to the wrong
# place; that is a bug worth chasing rather than committing.

straight/
elpa/
elpa.bak/
quelpa/
eln-cache/
backups/
auto-save-list/
undo/
undo-fu-session/
svg-lib/
tree-sitter/
transient/
var/
url/
.cache/
recentf
projects
tramp
places
saveplace
custom.el
session.*
.lsp-session-v1
*.elc
*~
\#*\#

# Dropbox conflict artefacts
*conflicted copy*
